## 📁 RULE #2: FILE MANAGEMENT

### Do Not Create
- ❌ `archive/` folders (use `git rm` instead)
- ❌ `*.bak`, `*_backup*` files
- ❌ `session_*.md`, `analysis_*.md` temp files
- ❌ New PM files in `naos/` root beyond core structure

### Do Update (not create)
- `naos/PROJECT_STATUS.md` — single source of project status
- `docs/DOCS_INDEX.md` — when adding new docs
- Existing spec files — add to them, don't create new ones

### Allowed to Create
- `naos/active/*.md` — story cards for active tasks
- `naos/completed/*.md` — completed task records
- `docs/exploration/*.md` — exploratory notes, spikes, and decision inputs (exempt from validation)
- Source files for features (with test coverage)

