## 📊 RULE #3: PM DISCIPLINE

- ONE source of truth: `naos/TASK_REGISTRY.yaml`
- All task status changes → `naos/TASK_REGISTRY.yaml` first
- Run `make -f Makefile.naos gov-refresh` after any registry change
- No duplicate status in multiple files

