## 💬 RULE #5: COMMIT DISCIPLINE

Every commit must reference:
- A task (`T-XXX`) or requirement (`FR-XXX`) OR
- A governance prefix (`chore:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `ci:`)

Bad: `"fixed stuff"` → invalid
Good: `"fix(T-042): Handle timezone in date parser"`

